  <wpt lat="38.65019226" lon="-0.3248099983">
    <name>Port de Tudons</name>
    <cmt>viewpoint</cmt>
    <desc>Port de Tudons is a popular mountain pass in the Alicante region, with steady gradients and scenic switchbacks that attract cyclists year-round. The summit offers open views and crisp air, making it a satisfying climb.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>overlook</type>
